## Metrolist — https://github.com/mostafaalagamy/Metrolist (GPL-3.0)

Valen's lyrics follow Metrolist's approach and port parts of its code:

- `providers/lyrics/…/LyprioLyrics.kt` is a port of Metrolist's `LyprioLyricsProvider`: the
  signed search (HMAC-SHA256 over the timestamp and body), protocol 2 with its polling, retry
  delays and jitter, the fall back to protocol 1, the second search with every source, and the
  check that a result names the right artist. No address or key of Metrolist's is included.
- `core/…/LyricsFormats.kt` reads the formats Metrolist reads (MLX text and its version 2 JSON,
  TTML word spans and backing vocals, enhanced LRC word tags, LRC offsets) and drops a leading
  "Title - Artist" header the way Metrolist's `removeLyprioIntroHeader` does; the readers are
  condensed to what Valen shows and are Valen's own code.
- The view's model (a clock carried between position reports, a line activated by its timestamps,
  the lines following on a spring and pausing after a scroll by hand, a tap that seeks) follows
  Metrolist's `LyricsView`; the drawing, the marks and the motion are Valen's own.

